WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.730
Is there salvation in this world?

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.690
Look! The monk's reading the paper!

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.740
It's probably just the swimsuit section of Sports Illustrated.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.290
Here it is. This world's one guiding light.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:19.790
Ah.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:25.830
That's it.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.420
So there you have it, Momochin.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.380
Today we'll finally get to enjoy the obligatory fanservice episode!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.090
The "s" in "fanservice" is for "sadism"!

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:39.600
Wonderful! It took eleven episodes, but we made it at last!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.390
Let's mark this joyous occasion with a song!

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:43.390
Yeah!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.990
And on that note, let's begin!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:09.290
It's already been one month since you first encountered Sakura Ichiko.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:14.750
I'm sure you are aware of the lack of favorable progress.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.710
Huh.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:20.090
We're both professionals, so I won't waste my breath on empty words of encouragement.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.180
I just want results. The sooner, the better.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:24.970
Is that clear?

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.260
Hell yeah!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:27.930
Excuse me?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.230
I got a rare monster!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:31.640
Huh?

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.110
Oh, shit. She looks serious.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.570
I understand! I'll do it!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.950
I'll do it ASAP!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.700
If you are unable to deliver, I regret that our next meeting will not be as pleasant.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.330
Your abilities will be marked as insufficient,

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.830
and I will be forced to bring you back for punishment.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.960
Do I make myself clear?

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.600
Damn, it's hot! What's with this?!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.810
Time to wash that sweat off in the shower.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.030
What's wrong, Kitty?

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:22.110
Aw, so he was the master of a named river?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.400
God of Misfortune...

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:24.910
...in the bathroom?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.870
I see, so it was a human...

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.080
They have no manners!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.410
But don't you worry,

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.660
I'll give you the very best service today.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.040
Eh? Wait a—

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.670
Oh, please! You're a customer!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.420
How's the temperature?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.890
What the hell are you doing?!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.510
Ladies' work.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.310
After so many failures, the cost of all those gadgets has drained my wallet dry.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.980
The only thing I can sell now is...

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.650
...my own body!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.070
But why are you doing it at my house?!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.400
And what the hell is this?!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.950
Huh? You want this girl?

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.450
The God of Decay has personally requested you, Icchi!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.500
Be careful not to make any mistakes, now!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.330
Huh?!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.920
Oh, and apparently you don't have to use your chest.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:22.000
The hell are you saying? Why do you want hers and not mine?!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.630
Just get the hell out, you idiots!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.180
Damn it, what is this?

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.100
There's no way in hell I can use the bath now!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.770
And while we're at it, you stink!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.980
Surely even a God of Misfortune bathes, right?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:42.110
Bathe, smathe! It's a waste of time.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.990
Then don't drag your filthy body in here!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.860
Look, your hair's a sticky mess too! How long's it even <i>been</i> since the last time you took a bath?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.290
What are you counting? Days? Weeks?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:05:59.290
Years.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:03.050
Get the fuck outta here and don't come back until you're clean!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.050
You wanna use my bath? Sure, jump right in!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.090
Thanks, Ranmaru.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.800
No worries!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.180
My father's in there right now, but you can go after him.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.600
That's fine,

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.350
but why are we going out back?

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.440
Sorry. Never mind.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.530
Huh? What's wrong?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.450
Man. Guess I'll just go to the public bath after all.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.700
Oh, lemme come with!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:38.080
Looks like that job earlier led to an unexpected turn of events.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:45.000
Sakura Ichiko won't be able to bring the Soumin Shourai into a public bath.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:02.980
<i>Oh my God... Today's my lucky day!</i>

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.610
Oh, Rindou.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.940
You guys have gotten pretty close lately, huh.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.320
Th-That's very kind of you!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.240
Why so polite?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.620
<i>I'm getting a bad feeling about this...</i>

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.490
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.540
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.120
I'm just glad that smelly tramp's not here.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.920
You think you can just stroll into the women's bath, dogshit?!

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.380
What are you doing?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.800
I can't believe you'd hurt a cute little puppy like that!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.770
Hey, mind your own business!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.360
K-Keita! Th-The dog...

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.860
turned hu-human...

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.700
Welcome! Come one, come all!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.240
Behold the strange but amazing transforming dog!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.660
This is good!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.830
Keita!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.200
The cat too!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.370
Cut it out, you two!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.750
Oh? Kitty can transform too?

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.630
Behold the strange but wonderful transforming cat girl!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:13.760
This is really good!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:14.930
Eh?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.810
<i>Huh? Am I the odd one out for being surprised?</i>

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.850
Her friends seem fun!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.360
All right! We're the first ones here!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.360
Yahoo!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.870
Don't run, Ryuuta! Sorata'll pick up bad habits!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.080
Aw, don't worry about it! It's just us!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.910
What are you doing, Ranmaru?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.040
Wha?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.170
U-Uh, nothing.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:51.550
Wh-When I think about how he's just beyond this wall...

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:59.430
A naked man and woman, separated only by a wall.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.680
My longing heart melts away into dew.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.690
Transcend this wall and reach him, my steaming desire!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.940
Deep... emotion!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.270
You're turning this into a bloodbath!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.900
Man, how unbecoming.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.740
Don't soil yourself over one guy.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.530
<i>Her breasts are huge!</i>

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>It's amazing! They're like balloons!</i>

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.290
<i>Do it! Do it!</i>

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.040
Wanna touch them?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.040
Can I?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.710
Sure, but it's 5000 yen a pop.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.550
Your brother might work himself to death to pay that back.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.430
If you're okay with that, touch away!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.310
5000 yen! 5000 yen!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.600
Everyone... I'm so sorry...

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.860
I don't want Keita to die!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.690
Hey, don't make my sister cry!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.240
Sorry! Just kidding! He won't die over 5000 yen!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:01.990
And besides, I'm sure you'll be as big as me when you grow up.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.290
Will I?

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.620
You will, you will.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.250
But seriously, what the hell does she have in there?

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:12.170
But my sister's still as flat as a washboard, so I don't think I have much of a chance.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.420
Rika! I'm still growing too!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.130
Probably...

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.840
All right, sound off!

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:18.760
One!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.800
Two!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.430
Dree!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:25.680
All right! I'll be the advance guard! Follow me!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.890
Lay off, you guys.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.060
Don't be such a tightass!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.980
I-It's not like I want to see Tittyko naked or anything!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.070
What are you, their guardian?!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.150
I <i>am</i> their guardian!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.400
But seriously, who do you think you are?

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:39.410
You're acting like little kids.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.370
The least you could do is let me bathe in peace.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:47.000
But man, a big bath like this is the best.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:52.460
It'll just wash away... the fatigue...

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.760
He got washed away!

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.720
Man, they sure are noisy over there.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:05.430
You'd think they'd have grown out of it by now.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.850
Wish they'd learn to keep it down in the bath.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.640
I'll wash your back, Ichiko!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.310
Thanks, Ranmaru.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.280
Don't mention it.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.490
Gadget of Misfortune:

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.030
"The Scourer You Gave Me!"

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:30.410
This seriously sadistic item inflicts great pain while abrading away the victim's very Fortune itself!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.710
Hm?

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.050
Ichiko, watch out! Momiji is—

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.970
Too late! Your Fortune is mine!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.570
Too late! Sakura Ichiko, your Fortune is min—

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.690
Watch out, Miss Ichiko!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.740
Why the hell are you in the women's bath?!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.160
Ahh... That double kick was pure bliss!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:11.960
Huh?

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:17.540
You... You knew my sisters were in there, right?

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.420
Stop it! Getting beaten on by a dude is a total turn-off!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:25.430
Behold, a man who has overcome the gods.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.930
Farewell, Momochin!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.930
Let's just stay out of this.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:34.400
Do you have any openings at all?!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.560
Think you could show off your own "openings" a little less?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.240
Nice one, Teddy!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.910
I'll let you off with a warning today.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:46.530
Adios!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.030
No! Stop her!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.040
Ow, that hurt...

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.670
You damn furball!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.920
Nice one, Kitty!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.380
Surprise attacks aren't playing fair, Momiji.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.430
Prepare yourself, beggar bitch!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.050
Hm?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.220
What's that?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.810
You were actually scared for a moment when you saw the towel, weren't you?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.810
Now, now, whatever could you be talking about?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.610
I know!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:24.900
You hate washing yourself, don't you? I've got you now!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.410
Help me, Ranmaru! She hasn't taken a bath in three years!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.870
Well, I can't let something like <i>that</i> slide! Request granted!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.870
Everyone's gotta bathe, Momiji!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.620
C'mere, Teddy! You're not getting away either!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.130
Nice! That felt good!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.180
She shrunk!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.350
Momiji!

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.220
Well, if we soak her in water she should return to normal.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.270
What is she, dried seaweed?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.360
See? She's back to normal.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.530
What is she, dried seaweed...?

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.580
Hmph. Have you thought about what you've done?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.580
Damn, I started sweating again.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.960
Hark, ye pitiable Dog God:

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:25.590
To die in such a place is certainly a regret.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:29.090
But rest ye in comfort,

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.350
for I will avenge thee!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.850
Cut it out already!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.310
What's wrong with you?

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.100
You're not a kid anymore! Act your age!

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:41.190
It's fine! Your sisters already left!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.730
That's not the issue here!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:43.610
So you're just nervous? Is that it?

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:50.160
Any red-blooded man would be interested in girls!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.120
Well...

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.240
Yeah, of course I am. A lot.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.120
But my brothers are watching!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.040
I'm not going to peep, nor will I encourage them to! I need to set an example!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.300
Keita! We're gonna head out first.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.510
In other words,

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:13.760
now that your brothers are gone,
there's nothing stopping you! Right?

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.720
I didn't say that.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.060
Be honest! Honesty is good!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.730
Those two are also my classmates.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.650
If this got out, I'd never hear the end of it!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.940
Not to mention, my brother owes his life to Sakura as well.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:31.360
So what if it gets out? We're only human, right?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.820
Rindou too.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:36.700
Even though she dresses like a guy, she's still a girl.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.540
There's no way I could let myself see her naked.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:42.620
He considered my feelings too! What a great guy!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.710
Really? He sounds pretty normal to me.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:48.260
...but anyway, I have no interest in her! None at all!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.890
She's all muscle, isn't she? Are you blind?

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.390
When she runs, her tits don't bounce at all!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.600
And besides,

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.390
the overwhelming majority of viewers say she's "cool" rather than "cute,"

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.980
and that her "woman-ness is wasted!"

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.440
Calm down, Ranmaru!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.440
Well, who cares.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.150
We both know who the flattest one of all is, and it ain't either of 'em.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.150
Careful there, monk.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.070
If you keep running your mouth like that, you'll—

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.820
—get the shit beaten out of you, baldy!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.660
Ah! Oh n—

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.370
W-Wow! Not an ounce of wasted fat!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.960
Nice cut!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.630
A-After seeing such an amazing body up close,

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.420
I can truly say my life is compl—

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.130
I have you now, girl!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:35.010
Provoking you into breaking the
wall was all part of my pl—

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.890
I have no regrets!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.560
Um... What do I do now?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.600
I was able to turn around in an instant, but...

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.310
Calm down, Keita! Remember what to do!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:52.570
Keita, at times like this, just start reciting the digits of pi.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.200
That's right! Thanks, Grandma!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:59.910
Three point one four! Three point one four!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.410
Three point one—

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.100
Emergency meeting! Emergency meeting!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.230
We have a code blue red alert!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:28.610
Find a way to defuse the current situation!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.940
Any ideas?!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.440
Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.610
Make an exception and kill him!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:33.940
Rejected!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.740
Hit him hard enough to cause memory loss!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.240
Rejected!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:36.950
Act bashful!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.490
What?!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:38.950
...Rejected!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.450
How about... pretending we don't know him?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.830
That's it! That's the only way!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.330
Calm down, the lot of you!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.330
It's no good! We're running out of time!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.920
Somebody do something!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.100
Um... I, uh...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.190
didn't see anything.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.820
That's a lie! He's lying! There's no way!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.790
Keita? What's wrong? There was this huge crash!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.790
Nothing! Go back, Ryuu!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.500
Why're you slouching?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.720
You sure took your time!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.140
What's wrong?

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.100
I'm feeling dizzy.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.430
What's that all about?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:47.770
But Keita, more importantly, I just can't stand that Sakura gi—

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:48.890
What is it?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.230
N-Nothing. Just please don't say that name right now.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.190
Why?

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.650
Because Keita is a guy too.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.280
Huh? What do you mean?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.780
What happened in there?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.660
I'm trying to come up with a backup plan right—

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.500
Bye-bye, Tsuwabuki. See you later.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.380
Huh? Who was that?

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.170
That goddamn thief...

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.670
She took my clothes, did she?

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:23.100
Well... I have bigger things to worry about.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.350
How can I show my face at school tomorrow?

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.440
I want to curl up into a hole...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.030
Why are you digging a hole?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.490
Oh, and they said it'd be a little bit longer to fix the bath.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.950
We should keep going to the public ba—

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.490
I'm never going there again!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.500
Oh, come on, Keita. I don't like open air baths.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.300
I thought of a new plan, Teddy.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.970
The usual you might've been against it,

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.980
but in our present state, I think this is the best way to move forward.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:39.400
Well, then... Let's go.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.530
Good morning.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.030
Oh.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.620
What's with that disguise?

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.870
You're one to talk. What's with that mask?

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.000
W-Well, you know...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:01.250
After everything I did yesterday, how can I face Tsuwabuki?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.260
What a baby. It's no big deal.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:09.390
All you did was see each other... n-n-na-naked!

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:14.640
I wish I could turn back time!

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:17.060
Hey, don't just block the door to the classroom!

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:17.940
You going in or not?

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:19.730
Tsuwabuki!

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:23.730
Seriously... you guys are full of beans from the get-go.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.160
He hates me!

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:35.000
He's thinking, "I don't even want to look at a girl who commits senseless acts of nude violence!"

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.250
He just doesn't want to show his face either.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.920
Man, enough is enough!

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.750
Why should I care what other people think?

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.260
Good morning, Ichiko!

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:53.260
Huh? Who are you?

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
Oh, come on! It's me, me!

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:01.440
Momiji, the God of Misfortune!

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:09.990
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga</i>!

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:18.620
Huh? This week I didn't appear once?

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:20.040
Of course I didn't!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.000
Did you really think I'd share the same dirty bathwater as those peasants?

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:26.090
"Of course I didn't," she says!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:26.960
That could also mean...

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:28.840
...there's no room in this show...

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:32.800
...for girls with no tits!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:34.930
Ow... Ow... It hurts... so good...
